{"id":"483058","name":"瘦肉鲍鱼汤","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/483058/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲍鱼","amount":"8只"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/483058/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"瘦肉清洗干净，切成小块，鲍鱼去掉内脏，清洗干净，表皮上切浅一点的花刀。","img":"images/483058/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"瘦肉块和鲍鱼加姜片，加稍宽的水，放入电高压锅，隔水炖。","img":"images/483058/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"高压锅炖30分钟，好了。","img":"images/483058/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加盐和鸡精调味，加枸杞，盛入小炖盅中。","img":"images/483058/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/483058/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"😁","img":"images/483058/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}